<title>USA: Mecklermedia stake cut by Feirstein.</title>
<headline>Mecklermedia stake cut by Feirstein.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York investment manager Barry Feirstein said Tuesday he reduced his stake in Mecklermedia Corp to 4.7 percent or 400,000 shares from 5.9 percent or 500,000 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with Securities and Exchange Commission, Feirstein, who owns New York investment management firm Feirstein Capital Management Corp, said he sold 100,000 shares between April 24 and May 2 at $22.51 to $26.75 each.</p>
</text>
